# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "4.3 Quantum entanglement and execution on a real quantum device {#43-quantum-entanglement-and-execution-on-a-real-quantum-device}"
msgstr "4.3 التشابك الكمومي والتنفيذ على جهاز كمومي حقيقي {#43-quantum-entanglement-and-execution-on-a-real-quantum-device}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's start by introducing a specific entangled state which is particularly important in quantum computation, then we'll define the term \"entangled\":\n"
msgstr "لنبدأ بالتعرف على حالة متشابكة بعينها ذات أهمية خاصة في الحوسبة الكمومية، ثم سنعرّف مصطلح \"التشابك\":\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}|00\\rangle + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}|11\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"and this state is called a **Bell state**.\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}|00\\rangle + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}|11\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An entangled state is a state $|\\psi_{AB}\\rangle$ consisting of quantum states $|\\psi_A\\rangle$ and $|\\psi_B\\rangle$ that cannot be represented by a tensor product of individual quantum states.\n"
msgstr "الحالة المتشابكة هي حالة $|\\psi_{AB}\\rangle$ تتكون من حالتين كموميتين $|\\psi_A\\rangle$ و$|\\psi_B\\rangle$ لا يمكن تمثيلهما بحاصل ضرب موتري لحالات كمومية فردية.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If $|\\psi_{AB}\\rangle$ below has two states $|\\psi\\rangle_A$ and $|\\psi\\rangle_B$;\n"
msgstr "الحالة المتشابكة هي حالة $|\\psi_{AB}\\rangle$ تتكون من حالتين كموميتين $|\\psi_A\\rangle$ و$|\\psi_B\\rangle$ لا يمكن تمثيلها كجداء تنسوري للحالات الكمومية الفردية.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_{AB}\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle +|11\\rangle) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle_A|0\\rangle_B +|1\\rangle_A|1\\rangle_B)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_{AB}\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle +|11\\rangle) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle_A|0\\rangle_B +|1\\rangle_A|1\\rangle_B)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle_A = a_0|0\\rangle+a_1|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle_B = b_0|0\\rangle+b_1|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle_A = a_0|0\\rangle+a_1|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle_B = b_0|0\\rangle+b_1|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "the tensor product of these two states is the following\n"
msgstr "حاصل الضرب الموتري لهاتين الحالتين هو التالي\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle _A\\otimes |\\psi\\rangle _B = a_0 b_0|00\\rangle+a_0 b_1|01\\rangle+a_1 b_0|10\\rangle+a_1 b_1|11\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle _A\\otimes |\\psi\\rangle _B = a_0 b_0|00\\rangle+a_0 b_1|01\\rangle+a_1 b_0|10\\rangle+a_1 b_1|11\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "but there are no coefficients $a_0, a_1, b_0, $ and $b_1$ to satisfy these two equations. Therefore, $|\\psi_{AB}\\rangle$ is not represented by a tensor product of individual quantum state, $|\\psi\\rangle_A$ and $|\\psi\\rangle_B$, and this means that $|\\psi_{AB}\\rangle =  \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle +|11\\rangle)$ is entangled state.\n"
msgstr "لكن لا توجد معاملات $a_0, a_1, b_0, $ و$b_1$ لتحقيق هاتين المعادلتين. لذلك، لا يمكن تمثيل $|\\psi_{AB}\\rangle$ بحاصل ضرب موتري لحالة كمومية فردية، $|\\psi\\rangle_A$ و$|\\psi\\rangle_B$، وهذا يعني أن $|\\psi_{AB}\\rangle =  \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle +|11\\rangle)$ هي حالة متشابكة.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let us create the Bell state and run it on a real quantum computer. Now we will follow the four steps to writing a quantum program, called **Qiskit patterns**:\n"
msgstr "لننشئ حالة بل ونشغلها على حاسوب كمومي حقيقي. الآن سنتبع الخطوات الأربع لكتابة برنامج كمومي، تسمى **أنماط Qiskit**:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map problem to quantum circuits and operators\n"
msgstr "تعيين المسألة إلى دوائر ومؤثِّرات كمومية\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optimize for target hardware\n"
msgstr "التحسين لأجهزة الهدف\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    3. '
